research/audit/wave8-real-analysis-cantor-continuity.findings.md-198-| `cex-dense-set-of-measure-zero` | “every one of those intervals meets every other and the union is dense.” | “although their union is dense because it contains $\mathbb{Q}_{\mathbb{R}}$.” | (a), containment of the dense rational set proves density; pairwise intersection is false for the stated cover. |
