research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-null-set-not-of-content-zero.md-2033-The implication from content zero to measure zero is
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-null-set-not-of-content-zero.md-2034-[[lem-content-zero-implies-null]] and needs no hypothesis on $K$. The other
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-null-set-not-of-content-zero.md-2035-direction is the one that uses compactness, and it uses it exactly as
