research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/lem-finite-interval-cover-total-length.md-1676-[L1] The construction: $N_0 = 1$, $e^{(0)}_0 = 0$, $\lambda_0 = 1$, $N_{n+1} = N_n + N_n$, $e^{(n+1)}_j = e^{(n)}_j$ for $j < N_n$ and $e^{(n+1)}_{N_n + j} = e^{(n)}_j + g_n$ for $j < N_n$; $S_n = \bigcup_{j<N_n}[e^{(n)}_j, e^{(n)}_j + \lambda_n]$; $S = \bigcap_n S_n \subseteq S_m \subseteq [0,1]$; $0 < \lambda_{n+1} < g_n < \lambda_n \le 2^{-n}$; $g_n + \lambda_{n+1} = \lambda_n$; $\lambda_n - 2\lambda_{n+1} = 4^{-n-1}$; and $\sum_{j<N_n} c = 2^{n}c$ for every real $c$ ([[def-fat-cantor-set]], [[def-interval]], [[def-integer-power]], [[lem-power-laws]]).
