research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-nowhere-dense-with-positive-measure.md-1156-[L6] There is a bijection $J : \mathbb{N} \times \mathbb{N} \to \mathbb{N}$ ([[thm-n-cross-n-countable]], [[def-injection-surjection-bijection]]).
