research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-function-properties.md-4161-[L5] A subset of $\mathbb{R}$ is compact exactly when it is closed and bounded ([[thm-heine-borel-characterisation-r]], [[def-open-cover-r]]).
