research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2342-**Both notions are inherited by subsets.** If $B \subseteq A$ and $A$ is null,
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2343-then any cover of $A$ covers $B$, so $B$ is null; the same sentence with finite
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2344-covers shows a subset of a set of content zero has content zero.
