research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2365-  is defined in this library, and no item here assigns a nonzero size to any set:
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2366-  every statement is of the shape "can, or cannot, be covered by intervals of
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2367-  total length below such and such a bound". That is a deliberate restriction of
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2368-  scope at this point in the reading order, not a claim that the general notions
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-cantor-set-properties.prompt.md-2369-  are unavailable in mathematics.
